      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL SELECT para BigQuery que te dará el recuento total de centros de atención médica, agrupados por el tipo de lugar de servicio:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    cs.place_of_service_concept_id,\n    c.concept_name AS place_of_service_concept_name,\n    COUNT(cs.care_site_id) AS care_site_count\nFROM\n    `care_site` AS cs\nJOIN\n    `concept` AS c\nON\n    cs.place_of_service_concept_id = c.concept_id\nGROUP BY\n    cs.place_of_service_concept_id,\n    c.concept_name\nORDER BY\n    care_site_count DESC;\n```"
          }
        ],
        "role": "model"
